          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "Move, Move, Melon!! is a whimsical on-rails runner developed under USC's Advanced Games Project. In this 40+ member AGP team, I contributed as a gameplay programmer shipping various game features and designer-friendly tools. ",
