    {
      "id": "sec_dc784864",
      "background": {
        "type": "reverse"
      },
      "padding": "md",
      "minHeight": "auto",
      "align": "top",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_a8436159",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 10,
            "row": 16,
            "rowSpan": 6
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "I partnered  with level designers and created the Mix-In Editor. This tool is built using Unity's IMGUI framework.<br>This intuitive tool can paint, edit, and bake Mix-ins without having to touch any GameObjects manually. This tool has led in increase productivity in all level iterations speed by about 250%.",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_3b3ee8eb",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 10,
            "row": 5,
            "rowSpan": 7
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "One of Move-Move-Melon's primary mechanic is this simple but addicting mechanic of collecting Mix-ins. However, it was difficult to iterate fast on the level designs as placing mix-ins wasn't intuitive at all. Designers had to manually add new gameObjects, dragging the prefab and adjusting the position manually.",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_cc3b1533",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 8,
            "row": 23,
            "rowSpan": 24
          },
          "type": "video",
          "props": {
            "url": "https://youtu.be/ry0JozfOAZc",
            "autoplay": false,
            "muted": false,
            "loop": false,
            "controls": true,
            "aspect": "16/9",
            "fit": "height",
            "radius": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_e3f3d055",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 10,
            "row": 49,
            "rowSpan": 8
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "Other than mix-ins, I also expanded the editor as a hub for all designer tools, adding checkpoint painter and level settings editor as well. I overall shipped about 4 designer-friendly editor tools that streamlined level design and asset management.",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_8b98e375",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 3,
            "row": 1,
            "rowSpan": 3
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "Challenges",
            "variant": "h3",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_51384d65",
          "layout": {
